32:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,32,18)\">Isa 32:18</ref> (+ <bdbheb>נְוֵה שָׁלוֺם</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִשְׁכְּנוֺת מִבְטַחִים</bdbheb>); of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s word <ref ref=\"Zech 9:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,9,1)\">Zech 9:1</ref> resting-place on journey, in <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שַׂר מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 51:59\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"59\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"59\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,59)\">Jer 51:59</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gf')\">Gf</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup> and others); figurative for security, assurance <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,17)\">2Sam 14:17</ref> (taken from <highlight>resting</highlight>, equilibrium, of scale according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>rest, quietness</highlight>, plural <bdbheb>מֵי מְנֻחוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 23:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,23,2)\">Ps 23:2</ref> = refreshment <ref ref=\"Isa 28:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,12)\">Isa 28:12</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַרְגֵּעָה</bdbheb>); <highlight>rest</highlight> (from enemies) = peace <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:56\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"56\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"56\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,56)\">1Kgs 8:56</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,18)\">1Kgs 5:18</ref>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִישׁ מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,9)\">1Chr 22:9</ref> <highlight>a man of peace</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>הֵנִיחַ</bdbheb> v<sup>b</sup>); = relief from sorrow <ref ref=\"Jer 45:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,45,3)\">Jer 45:3</ref> <highlight>condition of rest</highlight> and security attained by marriage <ref ref=\"Ruth 1:9\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(8,1,9)\">Ruth 1:9</ref> (= <bdbheb>מָנוֺחַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ruth 3:1\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(8,3,1)\">Ruth 3:1</ref>). — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:43\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,43)\">Judg 20:43</ref> is perhaps proper name, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM</lookup>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Mic 2:10", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 2, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Gen 49:15", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 49, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "2Sam 14:17", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ps 95:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 95, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 132:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 132, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Chr 6:41", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 41}, {"raw": "Isa 11:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 11, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Zech 9:1", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 9, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Isa 32:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 32, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Ps 23:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 23, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Num 10:33", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 10, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Deut 12:9", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 12, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 132:14", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 132, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Isa 66:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 66, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "1Chr 28:2", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 28, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Jer 51:59", "book": "JER", "chapter": 51, "verse": 59}, {"raw": "Isa 28:12", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Kgs 8:56", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 8, "verse": 56}, {"raw": "1Kgs 5:18", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 5, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "1Chr 22:9", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 22, "verse": 9}